            { q: "What is the PASTA threat modeling methodology?", opts: ["A food-related security framework", "Process for Attack Simulation and Threat Analysis — risk-centric, aligns threats with business impact", "A penetration testing method", "A compliance framework"], a: 1, exp: "PASTA is more risk-focused than STRIDE. It starts with business objectives and ends with attack simulation, aligning technical threats with business risk." },
            { q: "What should an Architecture Security Review evaluate?", opts: ["Only authentication", "Trust boundaries, authentication/authorization design, data protection, communication security, and resilience to attacks", "Compliance documentation only", "Code quality"], a: 1, exp: "Security reviews evaluate the entire security architecture: identity, data protection, network controls, resilience patterns, and logging/monitoring coverage." }
